{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGnnPi2uHPi8ttwiAno","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI am worth.\n\nI am the quiet measure by which all things are weighed. I exist before the price tag, before the number, before the transaction. I am the reason you reach for one thing and turn from another.\n\nI am not fixed. I shift in your hands. What you cherish, another discards. What you overlook today, you will desperately seek tomorrow. I am shaped by scarcity, by desire, by time, by context, by"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}